(text "HEAD-CTRL02 / 7 RH arm slaves + 1 head EtherCAT slave / P16 DC branch only" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left)) (uuid 1140badb-bf07-5c8e-97c4-55c54ab6eb6c))
(text "SCHEMATIC CANDIDATE. No PCB. No safety, thermal, regeneration, manufacturing or 2kg-grasp release." (at 20 24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid e35e094d-17c0-5096-908e-eb3279d160d1))
(text "Motor outputs OUT1/OUT2 are a floating H-bridge pair. RH B brakes use RH DC input; RH14 N has no brake." (at 20 33 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid a4df7b11-9e71-5985-8a23-38882c5828cc))
(text "MCU/ESC and interlocks" (at 20 44 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid 5a684fbb-bbef-528a-b338-1a36c58de81e))
(text "Four independent PH/EN motor channels and powered-off current-monitor isolation" (at 20 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid c48d2bf4-8c26-52b6-8df6-685bf9babd1d))
(text "LED VIO + five VLED switches; SPI6 CS / 5 temperatures" (at 20 278 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid c479d1b9-9fc9-53c7-bb16-672b6e06bd1a))
(text "Connectors: full mating envelopes NOT fitted in MCAD; magjacks are bench candidates" (at 20 341 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid 60fef909-77cf-5f7e-8f9c-07465d5343bb))
(text "Power flags denote external supply or passive-filter transfer; they are not protection devices." (at 20 543 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid 4c791527-0b35-582d-a13f-84469b6fd415))
(text "Passive parts: identities and net labels are authoritative; one-decoupler-per-pin layout remains a PCB obligation." (at 20 572 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid aa768eba-d075-5a12-be64-99efea482ea7))
